  * [package.json `"imports"` and self-name imports](https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/modules/reference.html#packagejson-imports-and-self-name-imports) ✅ matches `types`, `import`/`require` depending on syntax
  * [package.json `"typesVersions"`](https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/modules/reference.html#packagejson-typesversions) ✅
