Specifying [`outFile`](https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig#outFile) in conjunction with `--module amd` or `--module system` will concatenate all modules in the compilation into a single output file containing multiple module closures.
A module name will be computed for each module based on its relative location to [`rootDir`](https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig#rootDir).
