##  Cleaner output in `--watch` mode
TypeScript’s `--watch` mode now clears the screen after a re-compilation is requested.
##  Prettier `--pretty` output
TypeScript’s [`pretty`](https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig#pretty) flag can make error messages easier to read and manage. [`pretty`](https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig#pretty) now uses colors for file names, diagnostic codes, and line numbers. File names and positions are now also formatted to allow navigation in common terminals (e.g. Visual Studio Code terminal).
