Top level `await` may not work in all environments where you might expect at this point. Currently, you can only use top level `await` when the [`target`](https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig#target) compiler option is `es2017` or above, and `module` is `esnext` or `system`. Support within several environments and bundlers may be limited or may require enabling experimental support.
