###  Using `unknown` in Catch Variables
Users running with the [`strict`](https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig#strict) flag may see new errors around `catch` variables being `unknown`, especially if the existing code assumes only `Error` values have been caught. This often results in error messages such as:
```

