even?: number[];




odd?: number[];





constmyObj: EvenOdds = Object.groupBy(...);




myObj.even;



//    ~~~~


// Error to access this under 'strictNullChecks'.

```

This is because there’s no way to guarantee in a general way that _all_ the keys were produced by `groupBy`.
