##  _UMD_
A _UMD_ module is one that can _either_ be used as module (through an import), or as a global (when run in an environment without a module loader). Many popular libraries, such as 
```

ts

importmoment = require("moment");




console.log(moment.format());


```

whereas in a vanilla browser environment you would write:
```

js

console.log(moment.format());


```

